  "description": "Operating Area: Greece\n\nA classic icon re born\n\nA pristine masterpiece of yachting history, Northwind II seamlessly combines historic grandeur with modern coastal luxury. Her interiors were created by the world-renowned Maison Jansen - designers for the Kennedy White House, Coco Chanel, the Rockefellers, Onassis, and the King of Belgium. The fine woods were lovingly restored by the firm that restored Windsor Castle, and in 2026 she received a further refit.\nFeatured prominently in Architectural Digest in 2011, she offers an exclusive sanctuary for up to 10 guests in five staterooms - an experience defined by unmatched authenticity and character.",
